  "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#06090c\">\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"GT Terminal: browser-native systems, research, playable experiments, and spatial artifacts.\">\n<title>gtterminal :: signal node v2</title>\n<style>\n:root{\n  --bg:#06090c;--panel:#0b1318;--panel2:#081015;--text:#d7fff3;--muted:rgba(215,255,243,.68);\n  --cyan:#62ffe0;--amber:#ffd37a;--red:#ff4d6d;--line:rgba(130,255,230,.18);--shadow:rgba(0,0,0,.58);\n  --mono:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,\"Liberation Mono\",\"Courier New\",monospace;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html{background:var(--bg);color-scheme:dark}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--text);background:radial-gradient(1100px 650px at 50% 18%,#0b2225 0%,#061014 46%,#040607 100%);overflow-x:hidden}\na{color:inherit}.crt:before{content:\"\";position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:30;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(255,255,255,.035),rgba(255,255,255,0) 2px,rgba(0,0,0,.10) 4px);background-size:100% 6px;mix-blend-mode:overlay;opacity:.55}\n.wrap{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 28px));margin:auto;padding:20px 0 54px}.topbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:rgba(8,14,18,.78);box-shadow:0 18px 50px var(--shadow);position:sticky;top:8px;z-index:20;backdrop-filter:blur(10px)}\n.status,.meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(98,255,224,.55)}.chip{padding:5px 9px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:rgba(10,22,26,.55)}\n.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.3fr) minmax(280px,.7fr);gap:14px;margin-top:16px}.panel{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(10,22,26,.78),rgba(6,10,12,.78));box-shadow:0 20px 60px var(--shadow)}.pad{padding:18px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;color:var(--amber);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(30px,6vw,60px);letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:10px 0 10px;line-height:.96}.hero h1 span{color:var(--cyan);text-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(98,255,224,.2)}.lede{max-width:720px;margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.65}.cta{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid rgba(98,255,224,.28);border-radius:11px;padding:10px 12px;background:rgba(8,16,20,.78);font-size:12px}.btn.primary{border-color:rgba(98,255,224,.52);background:rgba(32,91,85,.22)}.btn:hover{border-color:var(--cyan);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n.console{height:100%;padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.console pre{margin:10px 0 0;white-space:pre-wrap;color:rgba(215,255,243,.76);font:11px/1.65 var(--mono)}.blink{color:var(--cyan)}\n.section{margin-top:14px}.section-head{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:9px}.section h2{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:var(--amber)}.section-note{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}\n.feature{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:14px;align-items:center;padding:16px}.feature h3{margin:5px 0 5px;font-size:19px}.feature p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.55}.states{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:9px}.state{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 7px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px}.state.active{color:var(--cyan)}.state.lab{color:var(--amber)}\n.directory{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px}.node{min-height:148px;text-decoration:none;padding:13px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:rgba(8,14,18,.65);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;transition:.16s ease}.node:hover{border-color:rgba(98,255,224,.48);background:rgba(10,24,27,.78);transform:translateY(-2px)}.node .num{font-size:10px;color:var(--amber);letter-spacing:.1em}.node h3{margin:20px 0 6px;font-size:15px}.node p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;line-height:1.5}.arrow{margin-top:12px;color:var(--cyan);font-size:12px}\n.signals{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:9px}.signal{padding:13px}.signal time{font-size:9px;color:var(--amber)}.signal h3{font-size:13px;margin:8px 0 5px}.signal p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.signal a{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;font-size:10px;color:var(--cyan);text-decoration:none}\n.tags{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap}.tag{font-size:10px;padding:6px 8px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;color:var(--muted);background:rgba(8,14,18,.55)}footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px;padding:13px 2px;color:rgba(215,255,243,.48);font-size:10px}\n@media(max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.directory{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.signals{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:560px){.wrap{width:min(100% - 18px,1120px);padding-top:10px}.topbar{top:5px}.meta .chip:first-child{display:none}.directory,.signals{grid-template-columns:1fr}.feature{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero h1{font-size:38px}.pad{padding:15px}.node{min-height:126px}.cta .btn{flex:1;justify-content:center}.crt:before{opacity:.36}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*:before,*:after{scroll-behavior:auto!important;animation:none!important;transition:none!important}.node:hover,.btn:hover{transform:none}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"crt\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <header class=\"topbar\">\n    <div class=\"status\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>GT TERMINAL / NODE ONLINE</span></div>\n    <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"chip\">STATIC WEB LAB</span><span class=\"chip\">2026</span></div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <section class=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"site-title\">\n      <div class=\"panel pad\">\n        <div class=\"eyebrow\">signal node / experimental web</div>\n        <h1 id=\"site-title\">gtterminal<span>::</span></h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Browser-native systems, research, playable prototypes, and spatial artifacts. Built in public, tested on real hardware, kept weird enough to remain useful.</p>\n        <div class=\"cta\">\n          <a class=\"btn primary\" href=\"systems.html\">Enter systems <span>↗</span></a>\n          <a class=\"btn\" href=\"artifacts/vanille-spatial-relief/\">View featured artifact <span>↗</span></a>\n          <a class=\"btn\" href=\"research.html\">Research logs <span>↗</span></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <aside class=\"panel console\" aria-label=\"terminal status\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"eyebrow\">boot / orientation</div>\n          <pre>&gt; mount /systems      <span class=\"blink\">OK</span>\n&gt; mount /artifacts    <span class=\"blink\">OK</span>\n&gt; mount /research     <span class=\"blink\">OK</span>\n&gt; mount /games        <span class=\"blink\">OK</span>\n&gt; mount /lab-tools    <span class=\"blink\">OK</span>\n\nsignal routing stable.\nvisitor agency enabled.</pre>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">WebGL</span><span class=\"tag\">audio</span><span class=\"tag\">AI systems</span><span class=\"tag\">glitch</span></div>\n      </aside>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"featured-title\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\"><h2 id=\"featured-title\">Featured signal</h2><span class=\"section-note\">active public experiment</span></div>\n      <article class=\"panel feature\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"eyebrow\">artifact / spatial web</div>\n          <h3>Spatial Relief Lab</h3>\n          <p>Turning ordinary 2D images into interactive browser-native spatial artifacts using layered depth, cohesion, splat rendering, disocclusion research, and mobile QA.</p>\n          <div class=\"states\"><span class=\"state active\">Active</span><span class=\"state lab\">Lab</span><span class=\"state\">Mobile WebGL</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <a class=\"btn primary\" href=\"artifacts/vanille-spatial-relief/\">Open fixture 01 ↗</a>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"directory-title\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\"><h2 id=\"directory-title\">Node directory</h2><span class=\"section-note\">filesystem-backed site map</span></div>\n      <div class=\"directory\">\n        <a class=\"node\" href=\"systems.html\"><span class=\"num\">01 / SYSTEMS</span><div><h3>Systems</h3><p>Atlas, GEF, Local LLM, Visualizer, Glitch Canvas, synths, sorting experiments and test nodes.</p><div class=\"arrow\">enter systems →</div></div></a>\n        <a class=\"node\" href=\"artifacts/vanille-spatial-relief/\"><span class=\"num\">02 / ARTIFACTS</span><div><h3>Artifacts</h3><p>Standalone interactive builds with their own runtime, evidence, and deployment life.</p><div class=\"arrow\">open artifacts →</div></div></a>\n        <a class=\"node\" href=\"research.html\"><span class=\"num\">03 / RESEARCH</span><div><h3>Research</h3><p>Directional collapse, local-file workflows, stop-humming notes, and future field reports.</p><div class=\"arrow\">read research →</div></div></a>\n        <a class=\"node\" href=\"Games/Index.html\"><span class=\"num\">04 / PLAY</span><div><h3>Games</h3><p>Playable experiments including Smash the TV and the Carnage TV top-down prototype.</p><div class=\"arrow\">launch games →</div></div></a>\n        <a class=\"node\" href=\"Lab%20tools/Index.HTML\"><span class=\"num\">05 / TOOLS</span><div><h3>Lab Tools</h3><p>Browser utilities and one-off instruments that earned a place on the bench.</p><div class=\"arrow\">open tools →</div></div></a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"signals-title\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\"><h2 id=\"signals-title\">Recent transmissions</h2><a class=\"section-note\" href=\"changelog.html\">full changelog ↗</a></div>\n      <div class=\"signals\">\n        <article class=\"panel signal\"><time>2026-08-24</time><h3>GT Terminal project family registered</h3><p>The site is now treated as a parent deployment family with independently routed child projects.</p><a href=\"index-v2.html\">current landing candidate</a></article>\n        <article class=\"panel signal\"><time>2026-08-23</time><h3>Spatial Relief Lab online</h3><p>The first spatial artifact moved from point relief through splats, mobile QA, and cohesion experiments.</p><a href=\"artifacts/vanille-spatial-relief/\">open artifact</a></article>\n        <article class=\"panel signal\"><time>LIVE INVENTORY</time><h3>Systems branch growing</h3><p>Atlas, GEF, Local LLM, Visualizer, Glitch Canvas, glitch-synth, lumasort, and test surfaces are present on the live node.</p><a href=\"systems.html\">inspect systems</a></article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer>\n    <span>gtterminal.neocities.org / signal node</span>\n    <span>static-first · dependency-light · built to be inspected</span>\n  </footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
